# toml-lite: simple array table — assert specific field
[include %libdir "toml-lite.llt"]

---

[match [call %.parse-toml-lite "[[item]]\nid = 1"]
  [Ok parsed]: [get "id" [get 0 [get "item" parsed]]]
  [Error msg]: [raise msg]]
